ChicagoBoss: build and run with OTP 29.
- Pin cowboy 2.12.0 and lager 3.9.2, whose older versions do not build.
- Do not fail dependencies on warnings, and enable tuple_calls everywhere,
  including the app modules boss compiles, as requests are tuples.
- Quote the type name maybe, a keyword since OTP 27.
- Take stack traces from catch clauses, as erlang:get_stacktrace/0 is gone.

